### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create a walking activity
POST http://localhost:3000/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Walking",
  "duration": 45,
  "distance": 2.8,
  "calories": 230,
  "averageHeartRate": 118,
  "timestamp": "2026-09-09T08:30:00.000Z"
}

### Create a pickleball activity
POST http://localhost:3000/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Pickleball",
  "duration": 60,
  "calories": 420,
  "averageHeartRate": 142,
  "timestamp": "2026-09-08T18:00:00.000Z"
}

### List all activities
GET http://localhost:3000/activities

### Filter by date range
GET http://localhost:3000/activities?startDate=2026-09-01&endDate=2026-09-09

### Delete one activity (replace 1)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/activities/1

### Delete all activities
DELETE http://localhost:3000/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "pat-local-delete" }
